.\" t460: unlace(1) man page
.TH UNLACE 1 "2025-05-13" "unlace 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
unlace \- decompile binary executables to C pseudocode
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B unlace decompile
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I BINARY
.br
.B unlace batch
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I BINARY
.br
.B unlace siggen
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I ARCHIVE
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B unlace
is a multi-architecture binary decompiler that produces C pseudocode from
ELF, PE, and Mach-O executables. It supports x86, x86-64, AArch64, ARM,
RISC-V, MIPS, PowerPC, V850, ARC, and Apple AGX architectures.
.PP
The decompilation pipeline lifts machine code to an intermediate
representation (IR), constructs SSA form, applies 50+ optimization passes,
recovers control-flow structure, and emits readable C output.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B decompile
Decompile a single function (or all functions with \fB\-\-all\fR) from a
binary. The function can be specified by name or address.
.TP
.B batch
Decompile all functions in parallel, writing output to stdout or a
per-function output directory.
.TP
.B siggen
Generate FLIRT-compatible signature files from static library archives.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "decompile options"
.TP
.BI \-f ", \-\-function " NAME
Decompile the function with the given name or hex address (e.g., \fB0x401000\fR).
.TP
.BI \-\-emit " FORMAT"
Output format: \fBc\fR (default), \fBir\fR, \fBdot\fR, \fBssa\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-arch " ARCH"
Override auto-detected architecture. Values: x86, x86_64, aarch64, arm,
riscv64, mips, mips64, ppc, ppc64, v850, arc, agx.
.TP
.BI \-o ", \-\-output " FILE
Write output to FILE instead of stdout.
.TP
.B \-\-all
Decompile all discovered functions.
.TP
.BI \-\-timeout " SECONDS"
Per-function decompilation timeout (default: 30).
.TP
.B \-v ", \-\-verbose"
Increase verbosity. Diagnostics are selected with \fB\-\-log\fR or \fBRUST_LOG\fR.
.TP
.BI \-\-plugin\-dir " DIR"
Load plugins from DIR.
.TP
.BI \-\-max\-width " COLS"
Maximum line width for C output (default: 120).
.TP
.BI \-\-tab\-width " N"
Indentation width (default: 4).
.TP
.BI \-\-annotations\-load " FILE"
Load function annotations from a JSON sidecar file.
.TP
.BI \-\-annotations\-save " FILE"
Save annotations to a JSON sidecar file after decompilation.
.SS "batch options"
.TP
.BI \-j ", \-\-jobs " N
Number of parallel decompilation threads (default: all cores).
.TP
.BI \-\-output\-dir " DIR"
Write one .c file per function to DIR.
.SS "siggen options"
.TP
.BI \-o ", \-\-output " FILE"
Write generated signatures to FILE.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RUST_LOG
Diagnostic filter in tracing EnvFilter syntax (default \fBwarn\fR), e.g.
\fBunlace::sccp=debug\fR. \fB\-\-log\fR overrides it.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Directory searched for \fBunlace/config.toml\fR when neither
\fB\-\-config\fR nor \fB./unlace.toml\fR is given (default
\fB~/.config\fR).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Decompilation failed (partial results may have been emitted).
.TP
.B 2
Invalid arguments or unrecognized binary format.
.SH EXAMPLES
Decompile the \fBmain\fR function:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ unlace decompile ./binary --function main
.fi
.RE
.PP
Decompile all functions to a directory:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ unlace batch ./binary --output-dir ./out/ --jobs 8
.fi
.RE
.PP
Generate FLIRT signatures from a static library:
.PP
.RS
.nf
$ unlace siggen ./libc.a -o libc.sig
.fi
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/unlace/plugins/
Default plugin search directory.
.TP
.I .unlace-annotations.json
Default annotations sidecar (adjacent to binary).
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at <https://github.com/coleleavitt/unlace/issues>.
.SH AUTHORS
Cole Leavitt and contributors.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR objdump (1),
.BR readelf (1),
.BR ghidra (1)
